	(text "Q501 = fan ON/OFF only, never PWM the supply (<= 100 Hz).\nQ501 at 150 mA: 0.15^2 x 48 mOhm = 1.1 mW (AO3400A DS p.2).\nPWM 25 kHz on J502 pin 4 only (Q504 open drain).\nTach filter 1 k x 1 nF = 1 us; D502 clamps to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "881d68cf-65c5-424f-975e-b437c7fc41d6")
	)
	(text "EXT: <= 70 mA cont. @ 85 C (<= 120 mA @ 25 C, PTC DS p.4).\nShort: trip ~0.44 A @ -40 C < LM5163 IPEAK 0.63 A.\nON LED (12.2 - 2.9) / 4.7 k = 2.0 mA; VC 24.4 V < VDS 30 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.74 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c59d5e6-c6e7-4dca-9f82-76c844fe039f")
	)
	(text "+12V budget (LM5163, sheet 01): fan 150 mA\n+ 2 x 70 mA EXT + 1.2 mA heater gate\n= 291 mA of ~470 mA DC (62 %, calc).\nPlace C502 / C503 at J501 / J502."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
